8,92,10,87,15159,24,22,20,92,12947,151645,198,151644,77091,198],"messages":[{"content":"Solve the problem step by step. Give your final answer in \\boxed{...}.\n\nGiven that \\begin{align*}x_{1}&=211,\\\\ x_{2}&=375,\\\\ x_{3}&=420,\\\\ x_{4}&=523,\\ \\text{and}\\\\ x_{n}&=x_{n-1}-x_{n-2}+x_{n-3}-x_{n-4}\\ \\text{when}\\ n\\geq5, \\end{align*}find the value of $x_{531}+x_{753}+x_{975}$.","role":"user"}],"rendered_sha256":"46157dd55ff5955642535ba35ea2e04bde1667fd990255f0e22502ac7e4efaa2"},"seconds":33.23223400115967,"seed":365260849232474469,"stop":"eos","text":"To solve for \\(x_{531} + x_{753} + x_{975}\\), we first need to understand the pattern in the sequence defined by the recurrence relation \\(x_n = x_{n-1} - x_{n-2} + x_{n-3} - x_{n-4}\\) for \\(n \\geq 5\\).\n\nLet's compute the first few terms of the sequence:\n\\[\nx_1 = 211, \\quad x_2 = 375, \\quad x_3 = 420, \\quad x_4 = 523\n\\]\n\\[\nx_5 = x_4 - x_3 + x_2 - x_1 = 523 - 420 + 375 - 211 = 267\n\\]\n\\[\nx_6 = x_5 - x_4 + x_3 - x_2 = 267 - 523 + 420 - 375 = -111\n\\]\n\\[\nx_7 = x_6 - x_5 + x_4 - x_3 = -111 - 267 + 523 - 420 = -275\n\\]\n\\[\nx_8 = x_7 - x_6 + x_5 - x_4 = -275 - (-111) + 267 - 523 = -410\n\\]\n\\[\nx_9 = x_8 - x_7 + x_6 - x_5 = -410 - (-275) + (-111) - 267 = -513\n\\]\n\\[\nx_{10} = x_9 - x_8 + x_7 - x_6 = -513 - (-410) + (-275) - (-111) = -513 + 410 - 275 + 111 = -267\n\\]\n\\[\nx_{11} = x_{10} - x_9 + x_8 - x_7 = -267 - (-513) + (-410) - (-275) = -267 + 513 - 410 + 275 = 111\n\\]\n\\[\nx_{12} = x_{11} - x_{10} + x_9 - x_8 = 111 - (-267) + (-513) - (-410) = 111 + 267 - 513 + 410 = 275\n\\]\n\\[\nx_{13} = x_{12} - x_{11} + x_{10} - x_9 = 275 - 111 + (-267) - (-513) = 275 - 111 - 267 + 513 = 400\n\\]\n\\[\nx_{14} = x_{13} - x_{12} + x_{11} - x_{10} = 400 - 275 + 111 - (-267) = 400 - 275 + 111 + 267 = 503\n\\]\n\\[\nx_{15} = x_{14} - x_{13} + x_{12} - x_{11} = 503 - 400 + 275 - 111 = 267\n\\]\n\\[\nx_{16} = x_{15} - x_{14} + x_{13} - x_{12} = 267 - 503 + 400 - 275 = -111\n\\]\nWe observe that the sequence repeats every 8 terms. To confirm, let's check the next few terms:\n\\[\nx_{17} = x_{16} - x_{15} + x_{14} - x_{13} = -111 - 267 + 503 - 400 = -275\n\\]\n\\[\nx_{18} = x_{17} - x_{16} + x_{15} - x_{14} = -275 - (-111) + 267 - 503 = -410\n\\]\n\\[\nx_{19} = x_{18} - x_{17} + x_{16} - x_{15} = -410 - (-275) + (-111) - 267 = -513\n\\]\n\\[\nx_{20} = x_{19} - x_{18} + x_{17} - x_{16} = -513 - (-410) + (-275) - (-111) = -267\n\\]\nThis confirms the periodicity of 8. Therefore, \\(x_{531} = x_{531 \\mod 8} = x_7 = -275\\), \\(x_{753} = x_{753 \\mod 8} = x_1 = 211\\), and \\(x_{975} = x_{975 \\mod 8} = x_3 = 420\\).\n\nThus, \\(x_{531} + x_{753} + x_{975} = -275 + 211 + 420 = 356\\).\n\nThe final answer is \\(\\boxed{356}\\)."},"grade":{"answer":"\\boxed{356}","correct":false,"format":"boxed","parseable":true},"id":"intermediate_algebra:854"}
